invalid type: string "respective state governments.\n2. EPF Registration and Contribution\nEstablishments crossing the 20-employee threshold must register with the Employees' Provident\nFund Organisation (EPFO) within the prescribed time.\nBoth employer and employee contribute 12% of basic wages + dearness allowance towards the\nPF account (subject to applicable wage ceiling rules).\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ